+- Moving a member (team transfer) takes the member out of the project in the
+  path and adds them to `toProjectId` with the same role. The caller must be a
+  manager of both projects: a non-manager → 403, a destination the caller cannot
+  read → 404, a destination in another organization → 404, an archived project
+  (either side) → 409. The user must be a member of the source project → 404,
+  and must not already be a member of the destination → 409. The destination
+  must differ from the source → 400. The move is all-or-nothing, and the
+  member's tasks in the source project are unassigned, since an assignee must be
+  a member of the task's project.
 
